      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793636496313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Docker Compose\n    - a yaml file that creates all these containers, etc.\n- Kubernetes locally (kind, etc.)\n\n- Aspire - It's basically kubernetes, but easy\n    - has a dashboard\n    - makes the environment \"Declarative\" (in code, \n         or something you can publish)\n    - very portable\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Docker Compose\n    - a yaml file that creates all these containers, etc.\n- Kubernetes locally (kind, etc.)\n\n- Aspire - It's basically kubernetes, but easy\n    - has a dashboard\n    - makes the environment \"Declarative\" (in code, \n         or something you can publish)\n    - very portable\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KXzozyunlDfgSusiOg-p9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 401,
      "y": 729,
      "width": 930.859375,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1774929280,
      "version": 362,
      "versionNonce": 1832759936,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793637288455,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- AppHost\n    - this is the Aspire thing. It doesn't go into production, it's just \n      a better docker compose or whatever. Provides the dashboard, too.\n- ServiceDefaults - There is a template, but every project I've been on had something like this.\n\n\n- X number of:\n    - *.Api\n        - Software.Api\n    - *.Tests\n        - Software.Tests\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- AppHost\n    - this is the Aspire thing. It doesn't go into production, it's just \n      a better docker compose or whatever. Provides the dashboard, too.\n- ServiceDefaults - There is a template, but every project I've been on had something like this.\n\n\n- X number of:\n    - *.Api\n        - Software.Api\n    - *.Tests\n        - Software.Tests\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
