      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- You run your Unit, Unit Integration, and System Tests in the pipeline\n    - Do not run system integration tests in the pipeline (if you are, you are cool, this\n      is an 'industry best practice' - working towards it)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- You run your Unit, Unit Integration, and System Tests in the pipeline\n    - Do not run system integration tests in the pipeline (if you are, you are cool, this\n      is an 'industry best practice' - working towards it)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
