      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. \"Serverless\" - Amazon Lambda, Azure Functions, \n    - pay for actual use\n    - \"hibernates\" and wakes up your API as needed.\n    - That means your API has to be able to start fast enough\n       that an incoming HTTP request doesn't time out.\n2. Rolling updates, etc.\n    - K8s, openshift, etc you can do rolling updates (and rollback) and you want those fast too.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. \"Serverless\" - Amazon Lambda, Azure Functions, \n    - pay for actual use\n    - \"hibernates\" and wakes up your API as needed.\n    - That means your API has to be able to start fast enough\n       that an incoming HTTP request doesn't time out.\n2. Rolling updates, etc.\n    - K8s, openshift, etc you can do rolling updates (and rollback) and you want those fast too.\n",
